\f0\fs24 \cf0 The folder contains the data to perform the analysis.\
-> Data_lp.xlsx: contains the occurrence data of species per plot.\
-> dca_scores_plot.xlsx: contains the DCA scores on plot level for the community analysis.\
-> Mvsl_meta_data_29_01_2026.xlsx: contains the metadata and abiotic site conditions per plot.\
-> PCA_data_structure.xlsx: contains the results of the PCA analysis of ecosystem structure.\
-> Res_hier_par_CC.xlsx: contains the results of the hierarchical partitioning of the community composition for plotting.\
-> Res_hier_par_spec_richn.xlsx: contains the results of the hierarchical partitioning of species richness for plotting.\
-> Res_hier_par_structure.xlsx: contains the results of the hierarchical partitioning of the ecosystem structure for plotting.\
-> Results_hierpar_endemicity.xlsx: contains the results of the hierarchical partitioning of the endemic and native species proportion for plotting.}